  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUsing the GEOBOARD application on your calculator, draw the kite with vertices at (4, 0), (1, 5), (4, 7), and (7, 5).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20109\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qapps.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20109\u0026quot;,108)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20110\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e to enter the application.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20111\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qapps.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20111\u0026quot;,108)\"\u003e and select \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20112\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e to start the GEOBOARD application. Press any key to start.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-1 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_5a_80/f-80-5a-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSelect a 10 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20113\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 10 square board.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20114\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e to select a 10 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20115\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 10 square board.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_5a_80/f-80-5a-2.gif \"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eTurn the axes on.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20116\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qzoom.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20116\u0026quot;,267)\"\u003e (\"FMAT\"), and press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20117\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdown.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20117\u0026quot;,136)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20118\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20118\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20119\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20119\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e to turn the axes on. Then press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20120\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qgraph.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20120\u0026quot;,157)\"\u003e (\"QUIT\").\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_5a_80/f-80-5a-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eMove to the point (4, 0). Press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20121\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20121\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e twice (\"DRAW\", then \"ADD\").\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20122\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20122\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e four times to move to the point (4, 0). Then press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20123\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20123\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e twice (\"DRAW\", then \"ADD\").\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThen press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20124\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qleft.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20124\u0026quot;,173)\"\u003e three times and \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20125\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qup.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20125\u0026quot;,246)\"\u003e five times, followed by \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20126\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20126\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e (\"ADD\") again to draw the segment connecting (4, 0) and (1, 5).\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-7 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_5a_80/f-80-5a-4.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eComplete the kite.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20127\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20127\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e three times and \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20128\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qup.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20128\u0026quot;,246)\"\u003e two times, followed by \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20129\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20129\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e (\"ADD\"), to draw the segment connecting (1, 5) and (4, 7).\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThen press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20130\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20130\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e three times and \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20131\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdown.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20131\u0026quot;,136)\"\u003e two times, followed by \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20132\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20132\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e (\"ADD\") to draw the segment connecting (4, 7) and (7, 5).\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFinally, press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20133\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qtrace.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20133\u0026quot;,240)\"\u003e (\"DONE\"). We now have our kite.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-9 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_5a_80/f-80-5a-5.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
